# Lennard-Jones model in reduced units; this is not water or a specific element.
# The bath supplies energy: watch lattice order disappear and neighbors change.
#/atom 1 0.48 #79D7FA
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 0.95
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_modify shift yes
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 0.12 49183 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
variable bath equal ternary(step<500,0.12,ternary(step<4500,0.12+1.48*(step-500.0)/4000.0,1.6))
fix thermal all langevin v_bath 1.6 0.2 82347 zero yes
timestep 0.004
thermo 500
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal
run 0
